- `HardwareStatusFooter.vue` - Device status indicators
- `stores/pos.ts` - Cart and payment state management
- `tests/e2e/pos/offline.spec.ts` - Comprehensive E2E tests
- `.codemachine/artifacts/task-i4-t5-completion-report.md` - Detailed completion report

